Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): stamp run_model on session-linked cards for the
 Desktop running row [daveey]

The newest run's model: attested session models when the run has ended, else its newest run_route
(concrete pin or class:<tier>). Display-only; failed reads stamp nothing.
